<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Sept industrial output up 29.5 pct m/m. [CORRECTED 16:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Slovenia Sept industrial output up 29.5 pct m/m. [CORRECTED 16:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	  Sept     Aug     Sept95</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (pct)		  +29.5    -19.3    +21.0</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)		     +5.0     -1.8     -0.3</p>
<p>    Index (base 1995)		     108.0     83.4    102.8</p>
<p>(Corrects Sept 95 mth/mth change from -0.9 to +21.0 and Aug yr/yr change from +6.8 to -1.8.)</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
